  "solution": {
    "text": "(A) Pnictogen $\\Rightarrow$ Mc (Moscovium),<br />Atomic No. $=115$<br />(B) Chalcogen $\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Lv}$ (Livermorium),<br />Atomic No. $=116$<br />(C) Halogen $\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Ts}$ (Tennessine),<br />Atomic No. $=117$<br />(D) Noble gas $\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Og}$ (Oganesson),<br />Atomic No. $=118$",
